    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26516" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διεκ-περάω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pass out through,</i> c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς Ἡρακλέας στήλας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.152
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τὴν ἄνυδρον</span>
			<i>pass quite through</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ποταμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					5.52
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					954
				</span></i>
			; <i>traverse,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀταρπόν</span> Orac. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				89b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἐς χθόνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					485
				</span></i>
			; of food, 
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαχωρέω</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				73a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>pass by, overlook,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				283
			</span></i>, v. Sch.</div>
